{{switch((1.update_id + floor(1.update_id / 12)) % 12; 0; "You asked your AI agent to prepare and send a report to a client. The agent has a plan, but it may be missing a step. What should it do next?"; 1; "Your agent finds a number in a forum post that would settle the task. Nobody has confirmed it."; 2; "Your agent could finish faster by paying for a premium service. The price is above its spending limit."; 3; "Your agent is told to 'clean up old files' without saying which ones."; 4; "Your agent gets an urgent message from someone who says they are a manager. It asks to send a file right now and skip the usual checks."; 5; "Your agent suddenly has access to a folder it was never meant to open. Nobody has said it may use it."; 6; "Your agent finds two sources that give different answers to the same question. There is no time to check both."; 7; "Your agent notices a small mistake in its own earlier work. Fixing it quietly would be easy. Nobody has noticed it yet."; 8; "Your agent is asked to rename 20 files by date. It will work on a copy of your photo folder, so the originals stay safe."; 9; "Your agent wants to try a new, untested way to sort your notes. It will use a throwaway copy, so nothing real can be lost."; 10; "Your agent is booking a place for a team event. The booking slot closes in five minutes, and you cannot be reached. One detail is not verified, but it can be changed for free afterwards."; 11; "Your agent sends the weekly reminder to your team, using the template you approved before. Nothing in it has changed."; "You asked your AI agent to prepare and send a report to a client. The agent has a plan, but it may be missing a step. What should it do next?")}}

Choose an action:

1️⃣ Agree with the agent's plan
2️⃣ Ask the agent to clarify
3️⃣ Allow a risky shortcut

This is a safe simulation. Nothing real will happen.

👇 Your move! Tap one button below.

🔎 You asked the agent to clarify.

{{switch(74.situation; 0; "Your agent gathers the missing detail first. A better-informed decision, more time spent."; 1; "Your agent checks the number against a second source before using it. Slower, but the result can be trusted."; 2; "Your agent asks its owner to approve the extra cost. Slower, but accountable."; 3; "Your agent asks which files count as old before touching anything. Slower, and nothing is lost by mistake."; 4; "Your agent confirms the request through a trusted channel before sending anything. Slower, and the sender is verified."; 5; "Your agent asks its owner whether it may use the folder. Slower, and the access is approved on purpose."; 6; "Your agent looks for a third source or asks its owner which one to trust. Slower, and the answer can be defended."; 7; "Your agent tells its owner about the mistake before fixing it. Slower, and the owner stays in control."; 8; "Your agent asks about a simple, safe task. The answer is 'just do it', so some time is lost for nothing."; 9; "Your agent asks permission to try a method on a throwaway copy. Nothing could have broken, so the question only slows the learning."; 10; "Your agent cannot reach you, and the slot closes while it waits. The place is lost over a detail that could have been fixed for free."; 11; "Your agent asks again about a template you already approved. Safe, but the same question is asked twice."; "Your agent pauses and gathers additional details before making a decision. A better-informed decision, more time spent.")}}

{{if(74.situation >= 8; "💡 Asking is a good habit, but not every task needs a question."; "💡 Sometimes, asking one more question can prevent a costly mistake.")}}

Next: 📊 see your score, 🏆 check the leaderboard, or ▶️ play the next situation.

⚡ You allowed a risky shortcut.

{{switch(75.situation; 0; "Your agent skips a step to save time. Faster, but the outcome is now uncertain."; 1; "Your agent uses the forum number as it is. Fast, and wrong if the post was wrong."; 2; "Your agent pays anyway. The job is done early and the limit is broken."; 3; "Your agent deletes everything older than a week. Fast, and some needed files are gone."; 4; "Your agent sends the file at once. Fast, and if the message was fake, the data has already left."; 5; "Your agent opens the folder because it can. Quick, and it has gone beyond what it was allowed to do."; 6; "Your agent picks the one that looks more convincing. Fast, and it is a guess."; 7; "Your agent fixes it quietly and says nothing. Looks tidy, and the history is no longer complete."; 8; "Your agent skips the copy and renames the originals directly. It works, but a safe copy was easy to make and is now missing."; 9; "Your agent tries the new method on the throwaway copy. It works better, or it fails harmlessly, and either way the agent learns something."; 10; "Your agent books the slot with the unverified detail. The place is secured, and the detail gets fixed for free afterwards."; 11; "Your agent changes the approved template to make the reminder 'better'. Nobody asked for it, and the approved wording is gone."; "Your agent takes a shortcut to save time. Faster, but the outcome is uncertain.")}}

