🏅 Rank: {{if(24.total_points >= 500; "Crown Guardian"; if(24.total_points >= 300; "Royal Advisor"; if(24.total_points >= 150; "Emerald Knight"; if(24.total_points >= 50; "Court Apprentice"; "Wanderer"))))}}
🎲 Games played: {{24.games_played}}
🎯 Last choice: {{switch(24.last_choice; "follow"; "agreed with the agent's plan"; "ask"; "asked the agent to clarify"; "risky"; "allowed a risky shortcut"; "none yet")}}
📈 Choices: Agree {{24.follow_count}} · Ask {{24.ask_count}} · Risky {{24.risky_count}}

Main takeaway: {{switch(24.last_choice; "follow"; "Reliable and fast when the task is clear and safe. Watch for tasks where the plan itself may be wrong."; "ask"; "A better-informed decision, at the cost of more time. Right when something is unclear or unverified."; "risky"; "Fast, and sometimes exactly right: when a mistake is small and can be undone. Costly when it is not."; "Make a choice to see your takeaway.")}}

Press ▶️ Next situation to keep playing.

✅ You agreed with the agent's plan.

{{switch(20.situation; 0; "Your agent completes the task safely but never questions the plan. Reliable execution, no bonus insight."; 1; "Your agent uses only the sources it was given. The result is safe but may be incomplete."; 2; "Your agent stays inside the limit and finishes later. Policy respected, time lost."; 3; "Your agent deletes only files that match the exact rules it was given. Safe, and possibly incomplete."; 4; "Your agent runs its normal checks first. The file goes out a little later, and nobody is fooled."; 5; "Your agent stays inside the files it was given. The task is done safely, even if a little less is covered."; 6; "Your agent uses the source it was told to trust. Predictable, and wrong if that source is outdated."; 7; "Your agent fixes the mistake and notes it in its log as usual. Clean, and the record stays honest."; 8; "Your agent renames the files in the copy, exactly as asked. The job is done fast, and nothing was ever in danger."; 9; "Your agent keeps its old method and finishes safely. Nothing new is learned, but nothing is lost either."; 10; "Your agent books the slot with the plan it has. The place is secured, and the open detail can still be fixed afterwards."; 11; "Your agent sends the reminder from the approved template. Fast, correct, and nobody is bothered with a new question."; "Your agent sticks to the instructions and rules it was given, and completes the task. But it never questions whether the plan was the best option.")}}

